From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Pitoiset <samuel.pitoiset@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:01:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] radv/rt: fix checking errors for imported binaries

It was silently skipped.

Found by inspection.

Fixes: b4d6d88c6b4 ("radv: add support for importing pipeline binaries")
Signed-off-by: Samuel Pitoiset <samuel.pitoiset@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 96009bf70c4234f12cf299bf2c025b9e7da657e2)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45215>
(cherry picked from commit 6ac7b4edacdb498c849d9ed16db1291bc93372d6)
---
 src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_rt.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_rt.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_rt.c
index 017bc3bb03c..986def2fa71 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_rt.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline_rt.c
@@ -1387,10 +1387,11 @@ radv_rt_pipeline_create(VkDevice _device, VkPipelineCache _cache, const VkRayTra
    } else {
       result = radv_rt_pipeline_compile(device, pCreateInfo, pipeline, cache, &rt_state, capture_replay_blocks,
                                         creation_feedback);
-      if (result != VK_SUCCESS)
-         goto fail;
    }
 
+   if (result != VK_SUCCESS)
+      goto fail;
+
    if (!(pipeline->base.base.create_flags & VK_PIPELINE_CREATE_2_LIBRARY_BIT_KHR)) {
       compute_rt_stack_size(pCreateInfo, pipeline);
       compile_rt_prolog(device, pipeline);
-- 
